@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

title lowes/auditor - Client-side Auditing Library Architecture

component "Integrating JVM Application" as App <<Application>>

package "Auditor Client Library (Kotlin/JVM)" as Lib {
  [Auditor API] as API
  [Diff Engine] as Diff
  [Filter Engine] as Filter
  [AuditEvent Builder] as Builder
  [Publisher Adapter] as PubAdapter
  [Logger Adapter] as LogAdapter
}

package "Abstractions" as Abstractions {
  interface "EventPublisher" as IEventPublisher
  interface "LogProvider" as ILogProvider
  interface "AuditEventElementFilter" as IElementFilter
}

package "Default Implementation" as Default {
  [KafkaEventPublisher] as KafkaPub
}

node "Event Stream" as Stream {
  [Kafka Topic] as KafkaTopic
}

artifact "AuditEvent (JSON payload)" as AuditJSON

' Inputs
[oldObject] as Old
[newObject] as New
[AuditorEventConfig] as Config

App --> API : audit(oldObject, newObject, config)
Old --> API
New --> API
Config --> API

API --> Diff : detect changes\nCREATED/UPDATED/DELETED
Diff --> Filter : apply includes\n(InclusionFilter)
Filter --> Builder : produce elements
Builder --> PubAdapter : build AuditEvent
LogAdapter ..> ILogProvider : logs

PubAdapter ..> IEventPublisher : publish via abstraction
IEventPublisher <.. KafkaPub : default binding

PubAdapter --> AuditJSON : serialize
KafkaPub --> KafkaTopic : send JSON
AuditJSON --> KafkaTopic
KafkaTopic --> [Downstream Consumers] : consume events\n(out of scope)

IElementFilter <.. Filter : uses filter contract

note right of API
- Accepts oldObject, newObject
- Applies AuditorEventConfig:
  applicationName, eventSource, eventSubType,
  metadata, element filters
end note

note bottom of Abstractions
Integration-oriented via abstractions:\nEventPublisher, LogProvider, ElementFilter
end note

@enduml